# French translation of the messages of odoo-mail-retry (msgid = English text of the code, msgstr = French translation).
# Standard PO format (Poedit, Weblate, Crowdin...). Empty msgstr = untranslated (English stays); identical to the msgid = valid in both languages.
# Messages are sentence FRAGMENTS (the code assembles sentences with variables): keep leading/trailing spaces and the order of the pieces.
